{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25133","headline":"题祖山人池上怪石 · 张碧","name":"题祖山人池上怪石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒姿数片奇突兀，曾作秋江秋水骨。\n先生应是厌风云，着向江边塞龙窟。\n我来池上倾酒尊，半酣书破青烟痕。\n参差翠缕摆不落，笔头惊怪黏秋云。\n我闻吴中项容水墨有高价，邀得将来倚松下。\n铺却双缯直道难，掉首空归不成画。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张碧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}